  "totalBlocks": 23,
  "translatedBlocks": 23,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "791ae15d2b1ac9b1",
      "translationZh": "机器学习演示",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "df78a6be706a8c6b",
      "translationZh": "机器学习演示正成为模型发布中日益重要的一环。演示让任何人——不只是 ML 工程师——都能在浏览器里试用模型、对预测结果给出反馈，并在模型表现良好时建立对它的信任。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "11af5b32490e60cb",
      "translationZh": "自 2019 年首个版本以来，用 Gradio 库构建的机器学习演示已超过 60 万个。今天，我们非常高兴地宣布 Gradio 3.0：一次从头开始的 Gradio 库重新设计 🥳",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "1eb2fa24cf5661a3",
      "translationZh": "Gradio 3.0 有什么新东西？",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3957685572f72345",
      "translationZh": "🔥 基于从 Gradio 用户那里听到的反馈，前端做了彻底重设计：",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4b6bacb4f587a301",
      "translationZh": "我们改用现代技术（如 Svelte）构建 Gradio 前端。结果是负载更小、页面加载快得多！",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1c6857ec4b726960",
      "translationZh": "我们还采用了更简洁的设计，让 Gradio 演示在更多场景下视觉上更协调（比如嵌入到博客文章里）。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f0d37b464b347f56",
      "translationZh": "我们改造了现有组件，例如 Dataframe 变得更友好（试试把 CSV 文件拖放进 Dataframe），并新增了 Gallery 等组件，让你能为模型搭出合适的界面。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "6e9acf55e0293781",
      "translationZh": "我们新增了 TabbedInterface 类，可以把相关演示作为多个标签页组合进同一个 Web 应用。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a89969706c852dbe",
      "translationZh": "在我们（重新设计的）文档 🤗 里查看所有可用组件！",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e3d0dead6a71ee2b",
      "translationZh": "🔥 我们创建了名为 Gradio Blocks 的新低层语言，让你直接用 Python 构建复杂的自定义 Web 应用：",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "39cca144bd6aa683",
      "translationZh": "为什么做 Blocks？Gradio 演示非常容易搭，但如果你想对演示布局有更多控制、或要求数据流更灵活呢？例如你可能想：",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "3b66649114ca6314",
      "translationZh": "改变演示的布局，而不是简单的输入在左、输出在右",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "670b000809830a01",
      "translationZh": "有多步界面：一个模型的输出成为下一个模型的输入，或更灵活的数据流",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "be6a451c4f0d873f",
      "translationZh": "根据用户输入改变组件属性（例如 Dropdown 的选项）或可见性",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ae9b721ac8f3d5c6",
      "translationZh": "低层的 Blocks API 让你直接用 Python 实现以上全部。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5287335d27679524",
      "translationZh": "下面是一个 Blocks 演示示例：创建两个简单演示并用标签页把它们组合起来：",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ead2cd75bf89da73",
      "translationZh": "运行 launch() 后会出现这样的演示：",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ef5826518183f117",
      "translationZh": "想循序渐进了解 Blocks，请看专门的 Blocks 指南",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "8fa73058c5e18b17",
      "translationZh": "Gradio Blocks 派对",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ac28bec9cc9b73d0",
      "translationZh": "我们对 Gradio Blocks 非常兴奋——也希望你来试试——因此我们正在组织一场比赛：Gradio Blocks Party（😉），看看谁能用 Blocks 构建最好的演示。通过构建这些演示，我们可以让最先进的机器学习触手可及——不只是工程师，而是任何会用浏览器的人！",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "966912da98573a0b",
      "translationZh": "即使你从没用过 Gradio，现在也是入场的完美时机：Blocks Party 将持续到 5 月底。派对结束时，我们会为用 Blocks 构建的演示送出 🤗 周边和其他奖品。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7a2c4f8338539317",
      "translationZh": "在这里了解更多 Blocks Party 信息：https://huggingface.co/spaces/Gradio-Blocks/README",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    }
  ],
